{"Title":"An Act prohibiting gunfire directed at dwelling houses","BillNumber":"H1681","DocketNumber":"HD2227","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"R_M2","Name":"Rady Mom","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/R_M2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T11:36:39.007"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"R_M2","Name":"Rady Mom","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/R_M2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T11:36:39.0066667"},{"Id":"RME1","Name":"Rodney M. Elliott","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RME1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T17:31:25.0866667"},{"Id":"EDJ0","Name":"Edward J. Kennedy","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/EDJ0","ResponseDate":"2023-04-24T10:17:05.4233333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H1681/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Mom of Lowell, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 1681) of Rady Mom and Rodney M. Elliott relative to the penalties for using weapons with intent to strike dwelling houses.  The Judiciary.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Chapter 269 of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by inserting after section 12F the following section:-\r\n\tSection 12G. Whoever discharges an assault weapon, firearm, large capacity weapon, machine gun, rifle, sawed-off shotgun, or shotgun, as defined in section one hundred twenty-one of chapter one hundred forty, with the intent to strike a dwelling, and as a result does strike a dwelling, shall be punished by imprisonment in the house of correction for not more than 2 ½ years, or in state prison for not more than 5 years, or by a fine of not more than $10,000, or both such imprisonment and fine.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J19","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J19"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}